Prefix Sum

Idea
Store cumulative sums so we can quickly compute subarray sums.
prefix[i] = sum of elements fro index 0 to i

Subarray formula
sum(l..r) = prefix [r] - prefix[l-1]

Example
nums = [1,2,3,4]
prefix = [1, 3, 6, 10]

Important extension
Prefix Sum + HashMap
Used when we want to count subarrays with a target sum.

Key relationship
runningSum - previousSum = target
So we check if previousSum = runningSum - target.